lue of the county&rsquo;s 4 grids September to October came in under 90% of normal in 38 of them. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 154% of normal in June to July and 39% in October to November. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 37% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 20608 had its driest year in 1963 at 63% of normal.</p>"}
